---
import { site } from "../../lib/site";

const weeks = [
  {
    name: "Week one",
    body: "We go through what you're trying to build, who it's for, what already exists, and what you're constrained by. Most of this is us asking questions and you correcting our answers.",
  },
  {
    name: "Week two",
    body: "We turn that into decisions: what's in the first version, what isn't, what each piece costs in time, and where we think the risk sits.",
  },
];
---

<section class="v3-section v3-section-tint" id="scoping" aria-labelledby="v3-scoping-title">
  <div class="v3-container v3-split">
    <div class="v3-split-head">
      <h2 class="v3-display-2" id="v3-scoping-title">
        Two weeks of questions, then a written scope.
      </h2>
      <p class="v3-body v3-on-light-secondary v3-scoping-lede">
        A consultation is two weeks and ends in a document. You can take that
        document anywhere.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="v3-scoping">
      <div class="v3-weeks">
        {
          weeks.map((week, i) => (
            <article class="v3-card v3-week" data-v3-reveal data-v3-delay={i * 120}>
              <p class="v3-small v3-week-n">Step {i + 1} of 2</p>
              <h3 class="v3-week-name">{week.name}</h3>
              <p class="v3-body v3-on-light-secondary">{week.body}</p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <article class="v3-card v3-output" data-v3-reveal data-v3-delay={240}>
        <h3 class="v3-week-name">What you get</h3>
        <p class="v3-body v3-output-body">
          The feature list, what's deliberately excluded, a build order, a
          time estimate against each piece, and the questions still open.
          It's yours to hand to us, another studio, or a developer you
          already have.
        </p>
        <a
          class="v3-link-dark v3-output-link"
          href={site.booking}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Book a scoping call
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .v3-scoping-lede {
    margin-top: var(--v3-space-4);
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  .v3-scoping {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--v3-space-6);
  }

  .v3-weeks {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--v3-space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .v3-weeks {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .v3-week-n {
    color: #55555f;
    margin-bottom: var(--v3-space-3);
  }

  .v3-week-name {
    font-family: var(--v3-font-display);
    font-size: var(--v3-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--v3-body-lg-lh);
    font-weight: var(--v3-w-display);
    margin-bottom: var(--v3-space-3);
  }

  .v3-output-body {
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .v3-output-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--v3-space-6);
  }
</style>
